msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Welcome! Will you be dining in or taking out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Neither, actually. Do you have any bones?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "I have a full skeleton of them, sir. Is... that all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "No, no, I mean a dog bone. You know, the kind they chew on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Oh, um..."
msgstr "Oh, ehm..."

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Nothing?"
msgstr "Niente"

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but no. This is a restaurant, not some kind of bone\r\n"
"emporium."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "...Right. Sorry for the trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Hello. Will this be for here, or to go?"
msgstr "Salve. Per consumare qui o da asporto?"

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "To go, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "All right. Here's our menu."
msgstr "Allora. Ecco il nostro menu."

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "For here, please."
msgstr "Per qui, per favore."

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "All right. Here's our menu."
msgstr "Allora. Ecco il nostro menu."

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "(No point eating now. I'm not even hungry.)"
msgstr "(Inutile mangiare adesso. Non ho neanche fame.)"

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Sorry, something came up."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, è saltato fuori un imprevisto."

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "All right, then. Please come again."
msgstr "Perfetto. Torni a trovarci."

msgctxt "1384"
msgid ""
"By the way, sir... you aren't from around here, are you? In that case, I "
"suggest you try our goya burger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid ""
"It's a local specialty that you can only find down here in beautiful "
"Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid ""
"We sandwich goya champloo between two toasted buns! Once you give it a try, "
"you'll be hooked!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid ""
"(The goya burger, huh? The ladies at the hostess club might be interested in"
" hearing about it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "To Go"
msgstr "Da asporto."

